    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2662a571315fed7b040aa1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车跑出过人的表现。观众为她献上\n如雷的掌声，这情景令训练员感动落泪。\n真弓快车一脸困惑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ba790f26017ab71f38ce08f8ebf0495d3d8af2daf4f02d8008ef1c67b91af8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
