      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……最后真弓快车得到一个结论。\n训练员做出完全超越她的常识范围的举动，\n真是个“怪人”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1141333a0722da1c724cf0687962b572d0b0db0072181a567b409e0624b23282",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
